{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kn210b21","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":64,"top":42,"width":1150,"height":68},"text":"M2: Cross-split contamination checks","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":36,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#173E5C","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/zmtk76lg","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":64,"top":123,"width":1152,"height":3},"geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#14847E","lineWidth":0}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/y1kjy1kv","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":1170,"top":672,"width":44,"height":24},"text":"9","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":16,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#5A6C78","alignment":"right"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/czi1wr2p","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":64,"top":475,"width":1140,"height":95},"text":"Near-duplicate rule: word-trigram Jaccard similarity of at least 0.85.\nShort queries use exact matching. Connected queries stay together.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243B4D","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/by9k36lk","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":64,"top":590,"width":1140,"height":70},"text":"Limit: lexical checks cannot rule out every semantic paraphrase.\nNo customer or conversation IDs are available for stronger grouping.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#5A6C78","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"table","id":"tb/gnat8vmt","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":64,"top":169,"width":1152,"height":264},"name":"","rows":4,"cols":3,"preview":"Split pair | Shared cleaned texts | Shared duplicate groups"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/n4izt9","slideIndex":8,"text":"Exact matches use normalized text. Near matches compare word-trigram sets, require at least three distinct trigrams in each query, and use Jaccard >= 0.85. Connections are transitive. This fixed audit examines test text but does not use test labels to choose parameters or train a model. verify.py independently recomputes matching from saved outputs. Source: preprocessing.py, reports/m2_stats.json and docs/DATA_CARD.md."}
