{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/algn21sb","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":64,"top":164,"width":540,"height":45},"text":"Privacy controls","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#14847E","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bmp4b69g","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":64,"top":238,"width":540,"height":237},"text":"Mask supported contact and numeric patterns.\nKeep unmodified raw files separate.\nOmit an unmasked text column from exports.\nRun the demo locally without storing input.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243B4D","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cny54ba1","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":664,"top":164,"width":540,"height":45},"text":"Known limits","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":29,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#14847E","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xo7mdgrm","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":664,"top":238,"width":540,"height":237},"text":"Regexes miss some names, addresses and IDs.\nEnglish banking queries only.\nNo sentiment or priority labels.\nNo measured operational time savings.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243B4D","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/2xw3yhsz","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":64,"top":518,"width":1152,"height":3},"geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#DBE4E9","lineWidth":0}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ni547m9k","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":64,"top":558,"width":1140,"height":95},"text":"We retain all official test rows, including 9 repeated normalized rows\nand 1 normalized-text group with conflicting labels. The data card discloses both.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#5A6C78","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/r8supo","slideIndex":9,"text":"Pattern counts, not confirmed PII: URLs/emails/card-like/phone-like values each match zero rows in these source files. Other number rule matches 205 official training rows and 49 official test rows. Processed CSVs omit original unmasked text but regexes can miss sensitive content. Public benchmark status is not proof of anonymity. Official test has nine repeated normalized rows and one conflicting normalized-text group; all official benchmark rows and labels are retained. Sources: docs/DATA_CARD.md and reports/m2_stats.json."}
